@host = http://localhost:5000

### Browse - get root folder
GET {{host}}/root

###

### Browse - list a folder
GET {{host}}/folder?path=C:\Users\bucki\Downloads

###

### Open a file (POST - opens in default app)
POST {{host}}/open?path=C:\Users\bucki\Downloads\jet_neptune.pdf

###

### Delete a file (DELETE)
DELETE {{host}}/file?path=C:\Users\bucki\Downloads\somefile.txt

###

### Rename a file (PATCH)
PATCH {{host}}/file?oldPath=C:\Users\bucki\Downloads\old.txt&newPath=C:\Users\bucki\Downloads\new.txt

###
